      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOLT OF FUN (7) is an honest type in the frame at 22 of 40 starts including last time when second (22.51) over 400m at this track. Solid record here winning four races. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. FROGS MONELLI (4) ran good time (22.46) winning a Grade 4/5 three back at this track but missed the frame latest finishing fifth at Cannington. Can find the frame this time. JAFFA'S MONELLI (2) was last seen getting around 300m at this track in a decent 17.14 for a 1.3 lengths victory. Top win latest and rates a key player again. KENTISH LASS (1) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot at big odds most recently.",
